            LyricWindow.place_randomly=_h95f5_place_randomly; LyricWindow.place_randomly._limbus_layer='H95F5'; LyricWindow.place_randomly._limbus_policy='mature-H61-placement-preserved; visual birth constrained to percentage region only'
